<%- include('partials/header') %>

<style>
    body {
        background: #000 !important;
        color: #d1d5db;
        font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    }

    .aks-privacy-policy {
        background: #000;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding-top: 120px;
        padding-bottom: 80px;
    }

    .privacy-wrapper {
        background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0d0d0d, #111111);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 50px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    }

    .privacy-top-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 8px 18px;
        border-radius: 50px;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .privacy-title {
        font-size: 3rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #ffffff;
        line-height: 1.2;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .privacy-subtitle {
        color: #9ca3af;
        font-size: 15px;
        margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .privacy-section {
        margin-bottom: 45px;
        padding-bottom: 30px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    }

    .privacy-section:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    .privacy-section h2 {
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 18px;
    }

    .privacy-section h2::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        top: 6px;
        width: 5px;
        height: 26px;
        border-radius: 30px;
        background: #ffffff;
    }

    .privacy-section p {
        color: #b0b7c3;
        line-height: 1.9;
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .privacy-section ul {
        padding-left: 20px;
        margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .privacy-section ul li {
        color: #c7ced8;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
        line-height: 1.8;
        font-size: 15px;
    }

    .privacy-email {
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: 0.3s ease;
    }

    .privacy-email:hover {
        color: #9ca3af;
    }

    @media(max-width: 768px) {

        .aks-privacy-policy {
            padding-top: 100px;
            padding-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .privacy-wrapper {
            padding: 30px 22px;
            border-radius: 18px;
        }

        .privacy-title {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
        }

        .privacy-section h2 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
        }

        .privacy-section p,
        .privacy-section ul li {
            font-size: 15px;
        }
    }
</style>

<main class="aks-privacy-policy">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-9 mx-auto">

                <div class="privacy-wrapper">

                    <span class="privacy-top-badge">
                        Privacy & Data Protection
                    </span>

                    <h1 class="privacy-title">
                        Privacy Policy
                    </h1>

                    <p class="privacy-subtitle">
                        Last updated:
                        <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', {
                            month: 'long',
                            day: 'numeric',
                            year: 'numeric'
                        }) %>
                    </p>

                    <section class="privacy-section">
                        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

                        <p>
                            We only collect information that you voluntarily provide when you contact us, submit a form, subscribe to updates, or interact with our website. This information may include your name, email address, phone number, and any other details you choose to share with us.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="privacy-section">
                        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>

                        <p>
                            The information collected from users is used to improve our services and provide a better experience on our platform.
                        </p>

                        <ul>
                            <li>Respond to inquiries and customer support requests</li>
                            <li>Send updates, newsletters, or promotional communications</li>
                            <li>Improve website functionality and performance</li>
                            <li>Analyze traffic, trends, and user interaction</li>
                            <li>Maintain website security and prevent misuse</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

                    <section class="privacy-section">
                        <h2>3. Cookies & Tracking Technologies</h2>

                        <p>
                            Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to improve user experience, analyze website traffic, and remember user preferences. You can disable cookies through your browser settings, but some features of the website may not function properly.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="privacy-section">
                        <h2>4. Data Security</h2>

                        <p>
                            We take reasonable and industry-standard measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure. However, no online transmission or storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="privacy-section">
                        <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>

                        <p>
                            We may use trusted third-party services to help operate our website, analyze performance, or improve user experience. These service providers only access information necessary to perform their tasks and are expected to protect your data responsibly.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="privacy-section">
                        <h2>6. External Website Links</h2>

                        <p>
                            Our website may contain links to external websites that are not operated or controlled by us. We are not responsible for the privacy practices, content, or policies of any third-party websites. Users are encouraged to review the privacy policies of those websites separately.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="privacy-section">
                        <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>

                        <p>
                            If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal information, you may contact us at:
                            <br><br>

                            <a href="mailto:ankitsingh.se72@gmail.com" class="privacy-email">
                                ankitsingh.se72@gmail.com
                            </a>
                        </p>
                    </section>

                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>